B.Oo=new A.kg("01","Voice Notes","AI \u2022 Productivity","https://github.com/amalmathew2003/note-app",B.FL,B.Gr,"assets/video/VN.mp4","The Smart Voice Note App is a Flutter-Firebase based mobile application developed to provide users with a simple, reliable, and efficient way to record, store, and manage voice notes. The primary goal of the application is to help users capture ideas, reminders, meetings, and personal notes instantly through audio, without the need for typing. The app emphasizes usability, performance, and clean architecture while maintaining a modern and intuitive user interface.\n\nIn today's fast-paced environment, users often need a quick way to save thoughts or information. This application addresses that requirement by offering a seamless one-tap recording experience combined with organized storage and smooth playback functionality. The app is designed to work offline, ensuring that users can access their recordings anytime without depending on network connectivity.\n\nKey Features:\n* One-tap high-quality audio recording\n* Automatic organization with date and time labels\n* View a list of recorded notes with timestamps\n* Play, pause, and control audio playback\n* Delete recordings when no longer needed\nThe application follows a clean and minimal UI approach, making it accessible for users of all age groups. From recording to playback, every interaction is designed to be intuitive and responsive.",B.Hc)
B.nh=s(["assets/images/travalappfull.png","assets/images/travalapp.png","assets/images/travalapp2.png"],t.s)
